    "section": "18. Transports",
    "ruleNumber": "18.06",
    "summary": "A unit needs a rule granting Assault Disembark. It must be riding in a Transport already on the battlefield. Neither boarding that Transport nor an Advance or Fall Back by the Transport can have happened this phase. Follow the Set Up procedure. Place every model entirely within 3 inches of the Transport.",
